# Rust
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# fenji-oodle's fuzz target, outside the workspace: its build, lockfile, corpus, crashes and
# coverage stay local (crates/fenji-oodle/fuzz/README.md).
/crates/fenji-oodle/fuzz/target/
/crates/fenji-oodle/fuzz/Cargo.lock
/crates/fenji-oodle/fuzz/corpus/
/crates/fenji-oodle/fuzz/artifacts/
/crates/fenji-oodle/fuzz/coverage/

# The desktop launcher (apps/launcher): its npm packages, the view's build, and the Tauri shell's
# build and the schemas it generates.
/apps/launcher/node_modules/
/apps/launcher/dist/
/apps/launcher/src-tauri/target/
/apps/launcher/src-tauri/gen/
/apps/launcher/src-tauri/permissions/autogenerated/

# Local reverse-engineering workspace: Ghidra/REA sessions, evidence bundles, decompiled output,
# extracted scripts, sandbox runs and stub logs. NEVER commit.
/re/
# The same tools' output wherever it lands outside re/ (scripts/check-forbidden-files.sh rejects it
# too): stub captures (the client's auth holds the machine's MAC and fingerprint), Oodle spools,
# decoded table caches and dumps.
stub-logs/
oodle-spool/
*.auth.bin
*.events
*.new_cache
*.jsonl

# Claude Code's agent worktrees
/.claude/worktrees/

